UPDATE bank_soal SET description='Elon Musk, born in Pretoria, South Africa, in 1971, is widely known as one of the most influential innovators of the 21st century. From an early age, Musk showed exceptional curiosity in technology and entrepreneurship. At 12, he created and sold a simple video game, marking the beginning of his lifelong fascination with innovation.

After moving to the United States, Musk co-founded several companies, including PayPal, which revolutionized online payments, and SpaceX, the first private company to send rockets into orbit. Through Tesla, he redefined the electric vehicle industry, promoting sustainable energy solutions and inspiring a global movement toward cleaner technology.

Despite numerous failures and public criticism, Musk remains determined and visionary. His story exemplifies that perseverance and creativity can transform ambitious dreams into real progress for humanity.

The antonym of the word visionary in the last paragraph is …', options='[{"id": "019ad651-525b-79bb-aec2-62735beb1313", "description": "Imaginative", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019ad651-525f-75ae-9175-d2fece7ac66a", "description": "Innovative", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019ad651-5262-7a71-b505-731daf7da76b", "description": "Shortsighted", "isCorrect": true, "point": 1}, {"id": "019ad651-5265-7ca9-a7aa-15d23764ff2b", "description": "Ambitious", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019ad651-5268-7e4b-8317-92ba2bb05eef", "description": "Creative", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}]'::jsonb, explanation='DIKETAHUI:
- Teks tentang Elon Musk: “Despite numerous failures and public criticism, Musk remains determined and visionary.” (Meski banyak kegagalan dan kritik publik, Musk tetap teguh dan visioner.)
- Kata yang ditanyakan: “visionary” di paragraf terakhir; yang diminta adalah antonimnya.
- Pilihan: Imaginative, Innovative, Shortsighted, Ambitious, Creative.

DITANYAKAN:
Lawan kata dari “visionary”.

JAWAB:
1. Kutipan: “Musk remains determined and visionary.” Di sini “visionary” menunjukkan orang yang punya pandangan jauh ke depan dan gagasan besar tentang masa depan.
2. “Visionary” = berpandangan jauh ke depan, penuh gagasan masa depan. Sinonim: forward-thinking, imaginative, innovative.
3. Karena yang diminta antonim, cari kata yang berarti tidak berpandangan jauh / hanya melihat jangka pendek.
4. Uji opsi: Imaginative = penuh imajinasi (searah); Innovative = inovatif (searah); Shortsighted = berpandangan sempit/jangka pendek (berlawanan); Ambitious = ambisius (searah, punya cita-cita besar); Creative = kreatif (searah).
5. Empat opsi bernada positif dan searah dengan visionary. Hanya “shortsighted” yang berlawanan (kebalikan dari far-sighted/visionary).
Jadi, jawaban yang tepat adalah (C) Shortsighted.

Mengapa opsi lain kurang tepat:
- (A) Imaginative: berimajinasi. Sinonim visionary.
- (B) Innovative: inovatif. Sinonim/searah; orang visioner justru biasanya inovatif.
- (D) Ambitious: ambisius. Searah; orang visioner biasanya punya cita-cita besar.
- (E) Creative: kreatif. Searah.', status='aktif', quality_score=4, quality_notes='Revisi: kunci C (Shortsighted) diverifikasi sebagai satu-satunya antonim ''visionary''; pembahasan dibersihkan dari catatan kunci lama.', reviewed_at=now(), updated_at=now() WHERE id='019ad651-5258-7030-9a2e-dda6e0659ec4';
