UPDATE bank_soal SET description='Arrange the words into a correct sentence:
an / making / is / important / announcement / the / chief', options='[{"id": "24f524a1-0ef5-4688-b152-d0dd3bd38e89", "description": "The chief is an important making announcement", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "821678d0-4ad5-47ec-802d-94745cd6bc5a", "description": "The chief is making an important announcement", "isCorrect": true, "point": 1}, {"id": "9301a924-1b6c-41de-b0bd-5fff34ba9897", "description": "The chief an important announcement is making", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "9dfa6a71-75c9-4fd8-b5a1-e9a389d972c3", "description": "The chief making is an important announcement", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "2102ba8d-8432-49b9-b71b-7bf641adfa9b", "description": "The chief is making important an announcement", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}]'::jsonb, explanation='DIKETAHUI:
- Kata acak: an / making / is / important / announcement / the / chief.
- the chief = frasa benda (sang kepala/pimpinan) sebagai subjek; is making = to be + V-ing; an important announcement = artikel + kata sifat + kata benda.

DITANYAKAN:
Susunan kata yang membentuk kalimat bahasa Inggris yang benar.

JAWAB:
1. Subjek: The chief (artikel the di depan kata benda chief).
2. Predikat: is making (Present Continuous: S + is + V-ing), karena subjek tunggal.
3. Objek: an important announcement. Urutan frasa benda adalah artikel + kata sifat + kata benda; artikel an dipakai karena important diawali bunyi vokal.
4. Gabungkan S + to be + V-ing + O: The chief is making an important announcement. Artinya: "Pimpinan sedang menyampaikan pengumuman penting."
5. Cek: ketujuh kata terpakai tepat satu kali.
Jadi, jawaban yang tepat adalah (B) The chief is making an important announcement.

Mengapa opsi lain kurang tepat:
- (A) The chief is an important making announcement: making menyelip di dalam frasa benda sehingga frasa rusak dan kalimat tidak bermakna.
- (C) The chief an important announcement is making: objek diletakkan sebelum predikat; bahasa Inggris berpola S + V + O.
- (D) The chief making is an important announcement: V-ing mendahului to be, padahal is harus berada sebelum making.
- (E) The chief is making important an announcement: kata sifat important mendahului artikel an; artikel harus berada paling depan dalam frasa benda.', status='aktif', quality_score=5, quality_notes='Diperbaiki: daftar kata lama (''a / important / making / is / decision'') tidak cocok dengan opsi dan kunci memakai kata di luar daftar. Daftar kata kini lengkap (termasuk ''an'', ''the'', ''chief'') dan kunci ''The chief is making an important announcement'' memakai semua kata tepat satu kali; dibedakan dari soal 019afc96-8266.', reviewed_at=now(), updated_at=now() WHERE id='8b7a27ee-92ff-4dab-ab1d-1fe0d83a9a33';
