UPDATE bank_soal SET description='Arrange the words into a correct sentence that begins with “Never”:
never / have / I / experienced / such / fear / before', options='[{"id": "019afc96-8284-72d0-8097-8f9a8b252b5f", "description": "Never have I experienced such fear before", "isCorrect": true, "point": 1}, {"id": "019afc96-8287-7bb1-bc06-f27c1ac18823", "description": "Never I have experienced such fear before", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019afc96-828b-7560-abf3-e83948d4f005", "description": "Never have experienced I such fear before", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019afc96-828f-7986-b61e-45d4a23a8bbb", "description": "Never experienced have I such fear before", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019afc96-8292-7e98-9e3d-3920c7ad577c", "description": "Never have I such fear experienced before", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}]'::jsonb, explanation='DIKETAHUI:
- Kata acak: never / have / I / experienced / such / fear / before.
- Syarat: kalimat diawali kata Never.
- Kalimat biasa (tanpa inversi): I have never experienced such fear before.

DITANYAKAN:
Susunan kalimat inversi yang benar dengan kata Never di awal.

JAWAB:
1. Jika kata keterangan negatif (never, rarely, seldom, hardly, not only) diletakkan di awal kalimat untuk penekanan, kalimat wajib memakai inversi: kata kerja bantu diletakkan sebelum subjek, seperti pola kalimat tanya.
2. Pola: Never + auxiliary + subject + main verb + ... Auxiliary-nya have, subjeknya I, kata kerja utamanya experienced.
3. Hasil: Never have I experienced such fear before. Artinya: "Belum pernah aku merasakan ketakutan seperti itu sebelumnya."
Jadi, jawaban yang tepat adalah (A) Never have I experienced such fear before.

Mengapa opsi lain kurang tepat:
- (B) Never I have experienced ...: Never di awal kalimat tetapi tanpa inversi; subjek I seharusnya berada sesudah have.
- (C) Never have experienced I ...: subjek I diletakkan sesudah kata kerja utama; inversi hanya memindahkan auxiliary, bukan kata kerja utama.
- (D) Never experienced have I ...: kata kerja utama mendahului auxiliary; susunannya tidak baku.
- (E) Never have I such fear experienced before: objek such fear menyelip di antara subjek dan kata kerja utama; seharusnya experienced langsung sesudah I.', status='aktif', quality_score=5, quality_notes='Diperbaiki: daftar kata lama tidak memuat ''have'' dan kunci tidak menguji inversi (sub materi ENG-16). Kata ''have'' ditambahkan, soal mensyaratkan kalimat diawali ''Never'', dan kunci menjadi bentuk inversi baku ''Never have I experienced such fear before''.', reviewed_at=now(), updated_at=now() WHERE id='019afc96-8280-7d22-a2e7-8c383dd866f0';
