UPDATE bank_soal SET description='Last Saturday, Officer Lina received a call from a local resident who reported a suspicious person near the parking lot. She immediately drove to the scene and (11) _______ the situation. The man appeared nervous and kept looking around. Officer Lina approached him and politely asked for identification. At first, the man (12) _______ to answer questions. However, after a few minutes, he (13) _______ and explained that he was waiting for his friend. After checking his ID and confirming there was no record of criminal activity, Officer Lina (14) _______ him to leave the area. She thanked the caller for being alert and reminded the public to (15) _______ any suspicious activity.

Which word best fits blank (11)?', options='[{"id": "01986461-e7f6-7dca-9077-d3b1ca64ba49", "description": "ignore", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "01986461-e7f9-73f2-a456-7cb18924a43e", "description": "assesses", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "01986461-e7fb-7803-a2a5-f064aee468fb", "description": "assessed", "isCorrect": true, "point": 1}, {"id": "01986461-e7fd-77b9-ae34-ff77cb4531f4", "description": "assessing", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "01986461-e7ff-79e0-a874-6b243908b887", "description": "ignored", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}]'::jsonb, explanation='DIKETAHUI:
- Kalimat rumpang (11): "She immediately drove to the scene and (11) _______ the situation." (Ia segera berkendara ke lokasi dan ... situasinya.)
- Kalimat-kalimat berikutnya menunjukkan Officer Lina mengamati pria itu, mendekatinya, dan memeriksa identitasnya.

DITANYAKAN:
Kata yang paling tepat untuk rumpang (11).

JAWAB:
1. Bentuk: kata hubung and menyejajarkan dua predikat. Predikat pertama drove (Simple Past), jadi predikat kedua juga harus Simple Past.
2. Makna: Officer Lina datang segera karena laporan, lalu mengamati dan menilai keadaan sebelum bertindak. Kata yang bermakna "menilai/mengkaji" adalah assess.
3. Bentuk lampaunya assessed: She immediately drove to the scene and assessed the situation. Artinya: "Ia segera menuju lokasi dan menilai situasinya."
Jadi, jawaban yang tepat adalah (C) assessed.

Mengapa opsi lain kurang tepat:
- (A) ignore: bentuk dasar tidak sejajar dengan drove, dan maknanya (mengabaikan) bertentangan dengan tindakan Officer Lina.
- (B) assesses: bentuk Simple Present, tidak sejajar dengan drove dan cerita masa lampau (Last Saturday).
- (D) assessing: bentuk V-ing tidak dapat menjadi predikat yang disejajarkan dengan drove.
- (E) ignored: bentuknya lampau, tetapi maknanya bertentangan dengan konteks; Officer Lina justru segera datang dan memeriksa pria itu.', status='aktif', quality_score=5, quality_notes='Diperbaiki: opsi lama (examined, checked, evaluated, assessed) semuanya cocok untuk rumpang (11). Opsi diganti sehingga hanya satu yang tepat secara bentuk (lampau, sejajar dengan ''drove'') dan makna; ditambahkan kalimat tanya yang menyebut nomor rumpang.', reviewed_at=now(), updated_at=now() WHERE id='01986461-e7f4-7d2b-b3a1-46abb428bcd2';
