UPDATE bank_soal SET description='Online learning has become an essential part of modern education. It allows students to access materials anytime and anywhere, making learning more flexible and efficient. Especially during the pandemic, online education proved that technology could replace traditional classrooms temporarily.

One major advantage is accessibility. Students in remote areas can attend virtual classes without needing to travel. Moreover, it encourages self-discipline, as learners must manage their own study schedules. However, online learning also presents challenges, such as limited interaction and distractions from gadgets.

In conclusion, online learning should continue to be developed alongside traditional education. With proper balance and support, it can make learning more inclusive and adaptable to the needs of the future.

What is one problem mentioned about online learning?', options='[{"id": "019a91dd-a7a1-72a4-af33-c5c5a96e8e38", "description": "Limited interaction and distractions from gadgets", "isCorrect": true, "point": 1}, {"id": "019a91dd-a7a4-71b1-8fde-489099bf4827", "description": "Students in remote areas cannot join classes", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019a91dd-a7a9-7aba-b0e3-a20ddb104053", "description": "Overuse of printed textbooks", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019a91dd-a7ac-74e2-b97e-0c8e4bba7269", "description": "Lack of self-discipline among students", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}, {"id": "019a91dd-a7af-746e-a2f8-693bd322dbc8", "description": "Lack of qualified teachers", "isCorrect": false, "point": 1}]'::jsonb, explanation='DIKETAHUI:
